sequenceDiagram
    participant API as risk-api process
    participant S as Scope sequencer
    participant L as Replicated log files
    participant D as Dispatcher process
    participant R as S7 receiver thread
    participant G as Gate7 order thread
    participant C as Local monotonic clock

    API->>S: Authenticated, validated command
    S->>L: Quorum commit complete version
    L-->>D: Tail committed log
    R->>D: Fresh challenge nonce
    D->>S: Forward challenge
    S-->>D: Certified HEAD: epoch, version, hash, nonce
    D->>R: Bounded delivery: versions, then proof
    R->>G: Atomic view: table, epoch, proof deadline
    G->>C: Every order: read monotonic time
    D-->>R: Proof or queue bound: stop confirmations
    G-->>G: If expired: perform A_stale
